{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36216","headline":"赠萧山彭少府 · 方干","name":"赠萧山彭少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"作尉孜孜更寒苦，操心至癖不爲清。\n虽将剑鹤支残债，犹有歌篇取盛名。\n尽拟勤求爲弟子，皆将疑义问先生。\n与君相识因儒术，岁月弥多别有情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}